[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 4204.149, "timestamp": "01:10:04", "text": "不是这个月，而是这个月。下个月"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4205.95, "timestamp": "01:10:05", "text": "不挂断"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4215.83, "timestamp": "01:10:15", "text": "本月？哦，就是这个月。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4220.51, "timestamp": "01:10:20", "text": "嗯，为什么最后一个是曼达洛人？那是什么？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4224.229, "timestamp": "01:10:24", "text": "行进？哦，上个月。是的，是的，是的。字"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4226.55, "timestamp": "01:10:26", "text": "我忘了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4228.07, "timestamp": "01:10:28", "text": "伊希"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4231.75, "timestamp": "01:10:31", "text": "不。这跟火有什么关系？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4243.47, "timestamp": "01:10:43", "text": "是的。哦，回家吧。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4247.27, "timestamp": "01:10:47", "text": "我刚才把麦克风静音了一会儿。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4256.07, "timestamp": "01:10:56", "text": "嘿。送到我家。啊，时光飞逝。我把它送达了。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 4258.91, "timestamp": "01:10:58", "text": "。我把麦克风静音了一会儿。"}]